Z||000006||LivoniaFieroGT||08-22-2001||11:17 PM||||The only solenoid on the V6 2.8 that is emissions related, is the EGR electric vacuum regulator solenoid.  GM part number 10038324.  It is located near the Oil Pressure sending unit.  I have a new one for $50 shipping included.  Can provide pic if needed.<BR>Rob||||reg||1
Z||000007||c m west||08-22-2001||11:36 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LivoniaFieroGT:<BR><B>The only solenoid on the V6 2.8 that is emissions related, is the EGR electric vacuum regulator solenoid.  GM part number 10038324.  It is located near the Oil Pressure sending unit.  I have a new one for $50 shipping included.  Can provide pic if needed.<BR>Rob</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>been there - done that, that part number is for a 93 - 95 camaro and the such, you will have to reverse the vacum fittings on your car for it to work, however it still will work<BR>||||reg||1
